ce log analytics  through an Innovative partnership with  bigquery Cloud logging now allows your  devops teams to get more value out of  the logs through the power of SQL  queries  with these capabilities your  organization can adopt a more secure  intelligent and sustainable devops  practice on behalf of Jerome and I we  hope you have a great next 2022.  foreign

